cascade\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: performance\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: manual\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:38:40 AM\n\n## Description\nFindingsView and SourcesView recompute filtered/sorted arrays on every searchQuery change via useMemo. When users type quickly, this triggers multiple filter operations per second. Debouncing the input (150-200ms) would batch these into single computations.\n\n## Reasoning\nFilter operations run on every keystroke. For 500 findings, each filter involves string.toLowerCase().includes() x500. Debouncing reduces computation by 80%+ during active typing without perceived UX degradation, as users expect slight delay while typing.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Views\n\n**Description**: Full-page report views for different sections: overview, findings, sources, analysis, entities, and perspectives. Each view provides deep-dive content for its domain.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/views/OverviewView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/FindingsView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/SourcesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/AnalysisView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/EntitiesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/PerspectivesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/index.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use `.claude/skills/compact-ui-design.md` for high-quality UI design references and patterns\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this i